{"content":"## Fixed — string-form latch values are now normalized

Applied the suggested one-liner in `js/sm/sources/githubSource.js` (`matchesGuards`, `mergeStateLatch` block):

```javascript
var latchWant = latchState ? q.mergeStateLatch[latchState] : null;
// Normalize string | string[] exactly like notMergeState /
